  "assumptions": [
    "The student enables the internal pull-up on D2 (INPUT_PULLUP); the rig releases D2 (high-Z) when the button is not pressed, and checks once, after releasing straight from low, that D2 then reads high",
    "A bouncy press or release is 7 level changes 1 ms apart (about 6 ms of bounce)",
    "The LED starts off after reset, so the first press prints ON",
    "Each message is a single line; trailing CR/LF is ignored"
